    "SFMT retained BSD3 declarations are paired with the canonical upstream license blob 6f9c4a6d6a13aaf4a3cd667b484c591949d57e0a as a reference; exact SFMT original source revision inside PPSSPP remains unspecified.",
    "MeloNX exact root MIT license conflicts with README GPLv3 declarations. Staged reference files excluded from current Legal packaging.",
    "MeloNX native binary dependencies have unproven source/build correspondence. Full native/runtime notice closure belongs to future staging, before shipping.",
    "Texture artwork terms remain pack-specific; ps2ktxpak MIT covers catalogue metadata, not a blanket permission for downloadable artwork.",
    "Historical buildbot core exact source/binary correspondence remains unresolved; no GPL snapshot alone closes it.",
    "Texture installer paths still filter generic README/LICENSE/NOTICE files; the preservation gap is documented without changing previously verified installer behavior.",
    "Five creator records await original-source confirmation; the verified credit supplement does not alter frozen catalogue authors fields.",
    "Existing host/RPCS3 license boundary, FBNeo fundraising restrictions, imported-data permissions and Canvas declarations remain open in the prior source-rights review."
  ],
